===persian===

عبور می‌کردم...
به وسعتِ یک دشت...
به زیرِ تابشِ رنگین‌کمان آوازت
کنار شاخه‌ای از لحظه‌های تُردِ سبز...
خموش گشتم و...
آغوش گوش وا کردم...
دویدم از چمنِ شوق... تا... تَهِ باران...
در اولِ خورشید...
هنوز گوش‌هایم می‌دید...
صدا رها کردم...
تو را... صدا کردم...
۱۳۷۰/۱/۱۳

===machine===

I was passing through...
wide as a plain...
under the rainbow-glow of your singing,
beside a branch of tender green moments...
I fell silent and...
opened the embrace of my ear...
I ran from the meadow of longing... to... the far end of the rain...
at the first of the sun...
my ears were seeing still...
I let my voice go...
I called... to you...
1370/1/13

===lantern===

I was passing through,
wide as a plain,
under the rainbow of your singing,
beside a branch of tender green moments.
I fell silent
and opened the arms of my ear.
I ran from the meadow of longing
to the far end of the rain,
and at the first of the sun
my ears were seeing still.
I let my voice go —
I called out to you...

1370/1/13

